  "title": "Meet Spotify’s First EQUAL Ambassadors for Podcasts and Audiobooks",
  "summary": "For five years, Spotify’s EQUAL program has helped amplify and celebrate women artists around the world. Since launching in 2021, EQUAL has supported more than 1,400 women artists across more than 40 markets through editorial programming, marketing campaigns, and cultural moments designed to help them reach new audiences. Now, EQUAL is entering a new chapter....",
